Z||000002||Cheever3000||10-31-2001||12:03 PM||||Wierd indeed.<BR>The front overhang is from an obvious add-on.  Note the location of the hoodline.  So you can't go by the headlights.  The rear, except for the window, looks untouched, and those taillights seem very familiar -- Ford maybe?  The rear window does look very Fieroish, but it's not.  The side view also seems familiar to me, something like a Pontiac 6000.  Somebody went to a lot of trouble to make an ugly car.<P>Any other opinions?<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever3000 (edited 10-31-2001).]||||reg||5
